-- title:
--   R8 opp-bank Loc slot tables (INJ/RETS/SRC)
-- statement:
--   Packed local-slot tables for the round-eight / R7-plain bit network at auxiliary width $R=27794$.
--
--   The tables record, for Jain's joint-frame-stack witness (`jfstack_23`):
--
--   - $\mathrm{TPTS}$: the three points of each lex triple $T$ (5-bit fields);
--   - $\mathrm{INJ}$: the three injection slots of each triple (16-bit fields), equal to the schedule's output slots;
--   - $\mathrm{RETS}$ / $\mathrm{RETN}$: the retained slot and DAG node of each centre $c\in\{0,\ldots,22\}$;
--   - $\mathrm{SRC}$: the source slot of each leaf/triple.
--
--   They are stored with the same `packL` limb encoding as the round-six BitNB GenData modules (65536-bit limbs, least significant first).
--
--   These constants are the Loc inputs to `injS` / `retS` / `srcS` used by the stage words and by `genF` when emitting `SG*` code states at local width $\mathrm{NL}=31359$.
--
--   **Formalization Note.** Lean module `IntMul.Kappa.R8.Bit.Oppbank.LocSlots`; source `certificates/round7/jfstack_23.json.gz` via `jfdata.load(23)`.
-- source:
